---
import {artistPortfolioStore} from '../../lib/studio/artistPortfolioProvider';
import {VISUAL_TIMING,VISUAL_TIMING_LABELS} from '../../lib/studio/visualTiming';
import {journalPhotoBucket} from '../../lib/studio/journalPhotoLifecycle';
import {symbolSources,directionState,VISUAL_DIRECTION_FIELDS} from '../../lib/studio/symbolJournal';
const {project,cards=[],cardId=null,mode='symbols',expressionLabels=false}=Astro.props;
const db=Astro.locals.supabase;
const artistStore=artistPortfolioStore(Astro.locals);let canDiscoverArtists=false;
if(mode==='direction'&&artistStore&&Astro.locals.user?.id===Astro.locals.profile?.id&&Astro.locals.profile?.status==='active'){try{canDiscoverArtists=(await artistStore.canCreator(Astro.locals.user.id))===true;}catch{canDiscoverArtists=false;}}
const [journalResult,photoResult]=await Promise.all(['studio_journal_entries','studio_journal_photos'].map(t=>db?.from(t).select('*').eq('project_id',project.id)));
const journals=journalResult?.data??[],photos=photoResult?.data??[],book=directionState(project.settings),sources=await symbolSources(project,journals,photos);
const photoUrls=Object.fromEntries(await Promise.all(photos.map(async(p:any)=>{const r=await db!.storage.from(journalPhotoBucket(project.settings,p.id)).createSignedUrl(p.storage_path,600);return [p.id,r.data?.signedUrl??'']})));
const labels={vision:'The world I want to create',colour:'Color relationships',composition:'Composition and breathing room',symbols:'Symbols that connect the work',treatment:'Artistic treatment',approach:'How the art will be made',exceptions:'Deliberate differences',rights:'Sources, credits and open permissions'};
---
<section class="symbol-visual-desk" data-symbol-desk data-project={project.id} data-owner={project.owner_id} data-card={cardId??''} data-mode={mode} data-expression-labels={String(expressionLabels)}>
 {mode==='direction'&&<fieldset class="art-route"><legend>How will you create the artwork?</legend><details class="art-route-help"><summary aria-label="Help with how you will create the artwork">?</summary><h4>Personal</h4><p>Would you like to make the images yourself, or explain your vision to an artist? You can change direction as the deck develops.</p><h4>Practical</h4><p>Both paths keep the same private ideas, references and detailed notes. Collaboration opens more space for an artist-facing brief; choosing it does not share anything or contact an artist.</p></details><label class="symbol-check"><input type="radio" name="art-route" value="self" data-art-route/><span>I will produce the artwork myself</span></label><label class="symbol-check"><input type="radio" name="art-route" value="artist" data-art-route/><span>I will collaborate with an artist</span></label><p data-art-route-note>Choose a working direction when you are ready. No information is removed if you change it.</p></fieldset>}
 <h3>{mode==='symbols'?'My Symbol Journal':'My Visual Discovery Board'}</h3>
 <p>{mode==='symbols'?'Keep an observation, question or research note with its card. A motif can connect several cards without having the same meaning in each.':'Choose references and describe why they belong to this deck. Your notes and selected sources come together in your private Visual Design Book.'}</p>
 <p class="studio-privacy-note">Private to this project. Nothing is shared with artists or communities. Selecting a reference gives no permission to reproduce it.</p>
 {mode==='direction'&&<details><summary>Explore working with an artist</summary><p>Discover approved portfolios without sharing this visual board or your journal. Artist registration is separate from creator membership, and the same account can hold both.</p>{canDiscoverArtists?<a class="studio-link-button" href={`/studio/artists/?project=${project.id}`}>Explore Artist Studio</a>:<><button type="button" disabled aria-describedby="artist-directory-pending">Artist directory — not connected</button><p id="artist-directory-pending">Artist discovery requires its reviewed backend and the appropriate creator access. Your private references remain here.</p></>}<p><a href="/artists/collaborate/">My artist profile</a></p><p>Artist discovery opens a separate consent workflow. Your board and journal are not attached automatically; this page sends nothing.</p></details>}
 <div class="symbol-workspace">
 <div>
 {mode==='symbols'&&<details><summary>Capture a symbol or observation</summary><form data-symbol-capture class="studio-form"><label class="studio-field"><span>Observation title</span><input name="title" maxlength="160" required data-symbol-help="captureTitle"/></label><label class="studio-field"><span>What I noticed or want to explore</span><textarea name="body_markdown" maxlength="50000" rows="5" data-symbol-help="captureBody"/></label><input type="hidden" name="entry_kind" value="reflection"/><input type="hidden" name="linked_card_id" value={cardId??''}/><input type="hidden" name="tags" value="research"/><button class="studio-button" type="submit">Save to my private Symbol Journal</button><p data-capture-status role="status"/></form><p>Add photographs or edit the complete observation in its journal entry after saving. The same source entry is used here; no second journal is created.</p></details>}
 <div data-symbol-entry-list/>
 {mode==='direction'&&<div><div class="art-shared-references"><h4>Ideas and images for either path</h4><div data-art-reference-previews aria-live="polite"></div><button type="button" class="studio-button studio-button--secondary" data-add-art-reference>Add a private reference image</button><p>Your original image and working preview are stored separately. Image uploads save separately from the written Visual Design Book; wait for their confirmation. Keep your own originals too.</p><label class="studio-field"><span>My private Pinterest board link (optional)</span><input type="url" data-direction-field="pinterest" data-symbol-help="pinterest" placeholder="https://www.pinterest.com/" maxlength="2000"/></label><p>We recommend keeping your Pinterest board private. Saving its link does not give an artist access, fetch its contents, connect Pinterest or send an invitation.</p></div><details data-artist-brief><summary>Detailed direction for an artist <span data-artist-detail-note>(kept privately for a possible later pivot)</span></summary><label class="studio-field"><span>What I would like an artist to understand</span><textarea data-direction-field="artistBrief" data-symbol-help="artistBrief" rows="5"/></label><p>Only an explicitly reviewed selection can be shared through the separate artist-consent workflow. This draft remains private.</p></details><label class="studio-field"><span>{labels.vision}</span><textarea data-direction-field="vision" rows="5" data-symbol-help="vision"/></label>{[{title:'Explore your visual language',keys:['colour','composition','symbols','treatment']},{title:'Artwork choices, differences and permissions',keys:['approach','exceptions','rights']}].map(group=><details><summary>{group.title}</summary>{group.keys.map(key=><label class="studio-field"><span>{labels[key as keyof typeof labels]}</span><textarea data-direction-field={key} rows="3" data-symbol-help={key}/></label>)}</details>)}</div>}
 </div>
 <aside>
 <h4>{mode==='symbols'?'Connections I choose':'References I choose'}</h4>
 <p>Choose a source, then record what it contributes. Its original writing and image remain in their existing record.</p>
 <label class="studio-field"><span>Source observation</span><select data-symbol-entry data-symbol-help="sourceEntry"><option value="">Choose an entry</option>{journals.map((j:any)=><option value={j.id}>{j.title}</option>)}</select></label>
 <label class="studio-field"><span>Motifs or connections</span><input data-symbol-motifs maxlength="1000" data-symbol-help="motifs"/></label>
 <label class="studio-field"><span>Why this matters here</span><textarea data-symbol-why maxlength="4000" rows="3" data-symbol-help="why"/></label>
 <fieldset><legend>Card associations</legend>{cardId?<><p>This observation connects to the card you are editing.</p><input type="checkbox" data-symbol-card={cardId} checked hidden/><details><summary>Also connect other cards (optional)</summary>{cards.filter((c:any)=>c.id!==cardId).map((c:any)=><label class="symbol-check"><input type="checkbox" data-symbol-card={c.id}/><span>{c.title}</span></label>)}</details></>:cards.map((c:any)=><label class="symbol-check"><input type="checkbox" data-symbol-card={c.id}/><span>{c.title}</span></label>)}</fieldset>
 <button type="button" class="studio-button studio-button--secondary" data-stage-symbol>Keep this connection in my draft</button>
 <p>Connections are your descriptions, not an automatic symbolic interpretation. Several relationship types and deliberate contrasts are welcome.</p>
 </aside>
 </div>
 {mode==='direction'&&<details><summary>Choose material for my private Visual Design Book</summary><p>No source is selected automatically. Selected text and references are recorded as a fixed source snapshot; later source edits ask for review.</p><div class="symbol-source-grid" data-discovery-sources/>
 <label class="symbol-check"><input type="checkbox" data-approve-sources/><span>I choose exactly these sources for my private Visual Design Book.</span></label><button type="button" class="studio-button studio-button--secondary" data-stage-sources>Use my selected sources</button></details>}
 {mode==='direction'&&<details><summary>When to develop each part of the visual plan</summary><p>These are timing suggestions, not chapter numbers, completion ratings or compulsory gates. Both artwork paths use the same guidance.</p>{VISUAL_TIMING.map(t=><article class="visual-timing"><h4>{t.stage} · {VISUAL_TIMING_LABELS[t.stage-1]}: {t.item}</h4><p><strong>Why:</strong> {t.why}</p><p><strong>If it changes later:</strong> {t.change}</p></article>)}</details>}
 {expressionLabels&&<p>Connections and visual notes share the existing Visual Design Book with The Visual World. Saving here preserves that shared document; it does not save card writing or create another copy.</p>}<div class="symbol-actions"><button type="button" class="studio-button" data-save-symbols>{expressionLabels?'Save my connections and shared visual notes':'Save whole Visual Design Book draft'}</button><details class="studio-local-recovery"><summary>Recover unsaved work</summary><p>Keep a local copy of current editor state. Normal saved outputs are in Exports.</p><button type="button" class="studio-text-button" data-symbol-draft>{expressionLabels?'Download unsaved connections and visual notes':'Download this unsaved direction draft'}</button></details><a href={`/studio/projects/${project.id}/project-book/?book=concept`}>View in My Project Book</a></div>
 <p role="status" aria-live="polite" data-symbol-status>Showing saved material. This is private project work.</p>
 <details data-visual-book-reading><summary>{expressionLabels?'Read saved connections and visual notes':'Read my saved Visual Design Book'}</summary><div data-visual-book-content/><a href={`/studio/projects/${project.id}/exports/#working-exports`}>{expressionLabels?'Open saved connections exports':'Open saved Visual Design Book exports'}</a></details>
 <script type="application/json" data-symbol-initial set:html={JSON.stringify({book,sources,cards,journals,photoUrls,updatedAt:project.updated_at}).replaceAll('<','\\u003c')}/>
</section>
<script>import {initSymbolVisualDesk} from '../../scripts/symbolVisualDesk';document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-symbol-desk]').forEach(initSymbolVisualDesk);</script>
<style>
.art-route{position:relative;border:1px solid #cec9c1;padding:1rem;margin:0 0 1.2rem}.art-route legend{padding-right:2.5rem;font:500 1.3rem Georgia,serif}.art-route-help{position:absolute;right:1rem;top:-1rem;background:var(--tok-studio-paper,#f2efe9)}.art-route-help summary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid #806c39;border-radius:50%;width:1.8rem;height:1.8rem;font:600 1rem Arial;list-style:none}.art-route-help[open]{position:static;display:block;padding:1rem;background:#eee8dc}.symbol-visual-desk :global([data-art-reference-previews] img){width:100%;max-height:160px;object-fit:contain}.symbol-visual-desk :global([data-art-reference-previews] figure){margin:.7rem 0;padding:.5rem;border:1px solid #cec9c1}.visual-timing{border-top:1px solid #cec9c1;margin:.8rem 0}.symbol-visual-desk{border-top:1px solid var(--tok-studio-rule,#cec9c1);padding-block:1.4rem;margin-block:1rem}.symbol-visual-desk h3{font:500 1.7rem/1.3 'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif}.symbol-visual-desk p{line-height:1.65}.symbol-workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,2fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1.5rem}.symbol-workspace>*{min-width:0}.symbol-visual-desk :global(.studio-field){display:grid;gap:.45rem;margin-block:1rem}.symbol-visual-desk :global(textarea),.symbol-visual-desk :global(input:not([type=checkbox])),.symbol-visual-desk :global(select){width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}.symbol-check{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:.65rem;margin:.65rem 0}.symbol-check input{width:1.1rem;height:1.1rem;flex:none;margin-top:.25rem}.symbol-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.8rem;margin:1.2rem 0}.symbol-visual-desk details{padding:.9rem 0;border-top:1px solid #cec9c1}.symbol-visual-desk summary{cursor:pointer}.symbol-source-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.symbol-visual-desk :global(.symbol-source){padding:.8rem;border:1px solid #cec9c1;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.symbol-visual-desk :global(.symbol-source img){display:block;width:100%;height:150px;object-fit:contain}.symbol-visual-desk :global(.symbol-observation){padding:.8rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cec9c1;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.symbol-visual-desk :global(.source-review){border-left:3px solid #8a6a1f;padding-left:.8rem}@media(max-width:760px){.symbol-workspace,.symbol-source-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.symbol-actions>*{max-width:100%}}
</style>
